  "readOnlyHint": false,
  "title": "Set quest objective state"
 },
 "description": "Tick, fail or reopen one objective of a quest by its id (get_mnemon's quest.objectives[].id), at any depth, without rewriting the quest. A GM sets any state. A player may only tick an objective they can see done, or undo that, and only while the quest's playersCanTick is on. Returns the quest as get_mnemon shows it, its progress recounted.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
